    {
      "id": "1321551524635218053",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2024-12-25T18:53:56.713+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "```The Cards Community in NationStates represents some of the most dedicated people in the game. Farming and collecting cards is a practice requiring many hours of hard work and administrative maintenance. Vylixan/Sitethief is one of these dedicated members, whose collections represent diverse themes from card farmers and Pacifican Senators to SciFi and fantasy. The thousands and thousands of cards they own are physical proof of their exceptional accomplishments in the realm of Cards.\n\nHowever, their collections aren't their only impressive accomplishments. Sitethief doesn't just hoard cards, but they give back to the community. Giveaways and pull events are some of the ways this can be done, which the Commendation authors document well, but Sitethief did not stop with that. Their technological contributions, between the projects they completed alone and the collaborative efforts they played important roles in, are representative of the innovation and dedication that the World Assembly should support.\n\nThe East Pacific believes Sitethief has more than exceeded our standards for commendability, and we are happy to support a unique resolution honoring a unique figure from our ally The New Pacific Order. For all of these reasons, TEP recommends a vote FOR this resolution.```",
      "author": {
        "id": "738186404399415336",
        "name": "theconstantofchange",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "Mango",
        "color": null,
